#. Description of the plugin
#: fobo-data-maker-forms.php
msgid "Renders Data Maker forms from signed .dmf uploads. POSTs sealed submissions to the Data Maker API; supports the localStorage-backed edit flow."
msgstr "从已签名的 .dmf 上传渲染 Data Maker 表单。将密封的提交内容发送到 Data Maker API；支持基于 localStorage 的编辑流程。"

#. Author of the plugin
